from preventable eligibility and health harms.", "children": [{"id": "6c30836c-d5e3-4f5e-ad6e-5e4169a6ce69", "type": "concept", "title": "USADA/WADA principles"}, {"id": "a63df23f-5e99-44fa-a465-7e5855fd3d4c", "type": "concept", "title": "Strict liability"}, {"id": "eb6477f6-45da-4cbb-8ea3-02abf2faf6e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication and supplement checks"}]}]}, {"id": "3db20a8d-c50b-46a6-b4a2-83f7039a1420", "type": "topic", "title": "Body Composition Assessment and Interpretation", "description": "Body composition is useful only when measured and communicated carefully. Students learn methods, assumptions, error, and ethical interpretation.", "children": [{"id": "cb41b2eb-c3d8-44fb-94bf-6eab0e527d71", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Assessment methods", "description": "Students compare tools based on validity, reliability, cost, and context.", "children": [{"id": "aa754ca4-455b-4ece-ab4f-d1dafa2061cf", "type": "concept", "title": "Skinfolds and circumference"}, {"id": "859918d3-da1b-49c1-92c9-69800e30abeb", "type": "concept", "title": "Bioelectrical impedance"}, {"id": "74654757-5972-4afa-9fff-016185a7a4de", "type": "concept", "title": "DXA and air displacement"}]}, {"id": "aae18660-d712-4943-911f-4b97811faf6d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Interpreting change", "description": "Students learn to distinguish real change from measurement noise.", "children": [{"id": "7f49dede-644c-43ad-bb08-833b3d36e069", "type": "concept", "title": "Technical error of measurement"}, {"id": "7f697cc5-39c7-4615-ba76-40d698ed6eb9", "type": "concept", "title": "Hydration and glycogen effects"}, {"id": "25fac7d8-073f-46dd-ab11-4dbd48db2c0f", "type": "concept", "title": "Meaningful vs. trivial change"}]}, {"id": "21f9e210-04e5-463f-a172-1b8604204dce", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ethical communication", "description": "Students learn to avoid weight stigma and appearance-centered harm.", "children": [{"id": "e86b1f74-596d-48c0-88f5-bd282045d48b", "type": "concept", "title": "Consent and privacy"}, {"id": "21a507ca-1146-429d-b5e8-8b140f6fa533", "type": "concept", "title": "Performance vs. health framing"}, {"id": "e71e6762-2e11-423f-b0f8-4fee62c297fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Language that supports autonomy"}]}]}, {"id": "9743075b-ea29-44ea-81ca-be24a6b35df2", "type": "topic", "title": "Weight Management, Muscle Gain, and Fat Loss", "description": "This topic examines body-mass change through health, performance, psychology, and sustainability rather than quick-fix dieting.", "children": [{"id": "29539c1b-98e5-4435-b76b-35b8a225cb27", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Fat loss principles", "description": "Students learn to create realistic energy deficits while protecting training and health.", "children": [{"id": "17e57c92-7758-4538-889b-ff82de48a8b6", "type": "concept", "title": "Rate of loss"}, {"id": "f736e5cd-e11c-460a-95be-6094c94080fa", "type": "concept", "title": "Protein and resistance training"}, {"id": "216c4f96-851c-4dfb-9fd3-1dcdcada56a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Hunger, adherence, and diet breaks"}]}, {"id": "f29ee869-a80e-4d1e-ba4c-60eea32b5852", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Muscle gain principles", "description": "Students learn how energy surplus, protein, and training interact for hypertrophy.", "children": [{"id": "7e340bd7-38d7-40d2-af92-31ff7d5b6069", "type": "concept", "title": "Caloric surplus range"}, {"id": "69b1c895-8eb9-4130-98a5-6427da974381", "type": "concept", "title": "Protein distribution"}, {"id": "653b2b66-2d2d-4612-b972-7b871ecec155", "type": "concept", "title": "Training stimulus and recovery"}]}, {"id": "cc3cbffc-f76d-45a3-8c14-060d0876696a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Maintenance and relapse prevention", "description": "Students learn that long-term outcomes depend on habits, environment, and monitoring.", "children": [{"id": "f58114d2-9647-489b-bb2d-13030cbdfc14", "type": "concept", "title": "Self-monitoring options"}, {"id": "7d5a2125-578f-41e8-9e83-6a03f355d9d5", "type": "concept", "title": "Flexible restraint"}, {"id": "bdbaccef-8827-4450-b3b4-1072a938093e", "type": "concept", "title": "Sleep, stress, and social support"}]}]}, {"id": "3138613b-648f-465e-94c0-7638f3adead0", "type": "topic", "title": "Special Populations and Life-Course Nutrition", "description": "Nutrition needs change across age, physiology, health status, culture, and sport context. Students learn to adapt recommendations while respecting scope of practice.", "children": [{"id": "d30fb374-39ff-4199-a8f3-3d2649866334", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Youth, collegiate, and masters athletes", "description": "Students learn how growth, maturation, and aging change nutrition priorities.", "children": [{"id": "976dc2b2-787d-4024-81a5-b74ade3396e4", "type": "concept", "title": "Growth and development"}, {"id": "8aad4d45-241a-4617-81ee-6e96c0780f5e", "type": "concept", "title": "Bone health"}, {"id": "c18d0633-06eb-41f3-93b3-a315c0dbe9c8", "type": "concept", "title": "Sarcopenia and recovery"}]}, {"id": "81345dd8-023b-446c-bf52-71a1ecdf0cd5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pregnancy, disability, and clinical considerations", "description": "Students learn when exercise nutrition intersects with medical nutrition therapy.", "children": [{"id": "02a2d264-692a-4d06-a758-bfd4d2785551", "type": "concept", "title": "Pregnancy and postpartum basics"}, {"id": "042ff88b-78da-4dfc-909c-cb8a7bf2dcfc", "type": "concept", "title": "Diabetes and cardiovascular risk"}, {"id": "a89c9a34-c0f5-450d-b2bb-ed2352ca9f22", "type": "concept", "title": "Adaptive sport considerations"}]}, {"id": "f77962a7-cb00-4a11-ba26-95437dac2120", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Plant-based and culturally diverse diets", "description": "Students learn to support performance without flattening culture or personal values.", "children": [{"id": "03c7eaa7-df21-4b9d-88ba-2e8e1e4732ab", "type": "concept", "title": "Protein planning"}, {"id": "31dc492b-d198-42db-9bc5-a6ee8842474f", "type": "concept", "title": "Iron, B12, calcium, vitamin D